  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>City XXL</strong> 是一款<strong>令人驚嘆</strong>的 Minecraft 超級地圖，擁有<strong>逼真的巨型城市</strong>，包含各式建築，例如商店、大樓、住宅、摩天大樓、辦公室、火箭發射站等眾多設施。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span><strong>建議 Minecraft 版本：1.12.2</strong></span></p><p><span><strong>支援的 Minecraft 版本：1.12-Snapshot；1.12；1.12.1；1.12.2；1.13-Snapshot；1.13；1.13.1；1.13.2</strong></span></p><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">部分圖片如下：</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://static.planetminecraft.com/files/resource_media/screenshot/1830/2018-07-29-15-58-43-1532876437.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"720\" height=\"404\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://static.planetminecraft.com/files/resource_media/screenshot/1830/2018-07-29-15-58-58-1532876441.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"720\" height=\"404\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://static.planetminecraft.com/files/resource_media/screenshot/1830/2018-07-29-15-59-21-1532876445.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"720\" height=\"404\"></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">您可以在 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fproject%252fcity-xxl%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Planet Minecraft</a> 觀看更多內容。</span></p>",
